Completed **Task B2: left panel (Layers rows, search, page selector)** strictly touching only paths in the B2 lane.

### Summary of Work
1. **Layers Tree (`src/editor/shell/left-panel/LayersTree.tsx`)**:
   - **Sliding Selection Band**: Real spring physics simulation (`Spring(0, preset.hl)`) driving ONE absolute `.lyhl.sel` band with velocity-dependent vertical stretch (`scaleY`) along travel; `.lyb1` on `#p-layers` renders single-selected row transparent so only the sliding band is visible.
   - **Hover Band**: `.lyhl.hov` follows pointer over rows using spring simulation.
   - **Ancestor Tint**: Ancestors of selected layers receive the `.anc` class with `color-mix(in srgb, var(--ll-sel) 35%, transparent)`.
   - **Folding Chevrons & Children**: Spring rotation on chevron (`mo().pop`), and children fold/unfold with staggered spring animation (`mo().rows`).
   - **Drag Lift / Part / Drop**: Dragged row receives `.ldrag`, surrounding rows part on springs (`mo().flip`), `.lyline` drop line indicates insertion position, target frame receives `.ldi` on hover, and rows support `ldb`/`lda`/`ldi`.
   - **Micro-interactions**: Eye vertical blink spring (`scaleY(0.15)`), Lock drop spring (`translateY(-5px)`), and Rename commit pop spring.
   - **List End Bump**: Bumps `#p-layers` on spring `--lyb` (`.lybm`) when scrolling/wheeling at boundaries.
   - **Edge Blur**: Subtle top/bottom edge blur mask (`.ll-list-edge-blur`) with no bulge.

2. **Search (`src/editor/shell/left-panel/LeftPanelHeader.tsx`)**:
   - Bouncy WAAPI morph transition from `#lsearchbtn` into full-width field matching prototype `openSearch(o)` (fade under reduced motion).
   - Calm field with clear button (`&times;`), match count (`#lscount`), and highlighted matched letters in layer names (`.nm .hit`).

3. **Page Selector (`src/editor/shell/left-panel/PageSelector.tsx`)**:
   - Replaced dependency on `PageSwitcher.tsx` with a dedicated `PageSelector` matching P.
   - 32px menu rows, checkmark `.llp-ck` on active page, route tooltip, "..." row actions flyout (`.llp-fly`: Rename, Duplicate, Delete), search filtering, and New page row.
   - Inline page renaming and full binding to `usePagesData()`.
   - Registered `window.LLPages` for prototype parity.

4. **Tokens & Demos**:
